DESCRIPTION:We are very excited to announce that MScAC is collaborating wit
 h Boson AI to host the "Higgs Audio Hackathon" from October 24 - October 2
 6 at 700 University Avenue!\n\nTo sign up: [https://forms.gle/Jose5X3xyZc
 YDZTi7] (https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2
 Fforms.gle%2FJose5X3xyZcYDZTi7&data=05%7C02%7Cclaire.mosses%40mscac.utoron
 to.ca%7C080d7fb5b4b54239e25e08de01f2c23b%7C78aac2262f034b4d9037b46d56c5521
 0%7C0%7C0%7C638950339316674481%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnR
 ydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%
 7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=2QDQIl7AqdceBMuIx1dUjdUwpLUriWou27xAybT2gZI%3D&reserved
 =0)\n\n \n\nThis is a great opportunity to push the limits of Boson’s n
 ewest audio model — [Higgs Audio V2] (https://can01.safelinks.protectio
 n.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.boson.ai%2Fblog%2Fhiggs-audio-v2&data
 =05%7C02%7Cclaire.mosses%40mscac.utoronto.ca%7C080d7fb5b4b54239e25e08de01f
 2c23b%7C78aac2262f034b4d9037b46d56c55210%7C0%7C0%7C638950339316706102%7CUn
 known%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW
 4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=ZKYK9Lfwp7PEsf3O
 1400VdZm%2FE0GlHtseiZY5XMePS8%3D&reserved=0)\, with the aim being to buil
 d fast\, break things\, and create novel applications using Boson's founda
 tion model as your launchpad. You'll also have the opportunity to connect 
 more with the Boson team\, who will be using part of this as their MScAC I
 ndustry Night!\n\nAdditional reasons why you should join: \n\n* TONS of p
 rizes including NVIDIA hardware\, Boson merch and swag\, compute credits\,
  project publicity and more.\n\n* Free food for the entire event including
  a pub night on the Sunday night.\n\n*\n\nBoson will be scouting for tale
 nt!\n\n*\n\nThis is the first hackathon MScAC has been involved in hosting
 \, so we hope to make it a memorable event with all our students.
LOCATION:9014/9016
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Boson AI + MScAC Higgs Audio Hackathon [CSC2703H Y LEC5101]
